es. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":266,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/266","source_state":"closed","source_author":"yoskini","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #266] feat: Add GTS documentation validator and associated tests","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore/#185_Validate_GTS_identifiers","pr_head_sha":"e519aa9a47de2acd90fc798a7d8533feee94d5d2","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"yoskini","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/266","id":3181980410,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs69qSr6","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/266","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/266.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/266.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/266","number":266,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: Add GTS documentation validator and associated tests","user":{"login":"yoskini","id":20127030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI3MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20127030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini","html_url":"https://github.com/yoskini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Introduced `validate_gts_docs.py` to validate GTS identifiers in .md and .json files.\r\n- Added unit tests for the GTS documentation validator in `test_validate_gts_docs.py`.\r\n- Updated Makefile to include targets for running the GTS documentation validator and its tests.\r\n- Enhanced `README.md` to document the new GTS validation features and usage.\r\n- Modified CI script to integrate GTS documentation validation into the CI pipeline.\r\n- Updated specifications to reflect changes in GTS identifiers for consistency.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a GTS documentation validator CLI, workspace integration, Makefile targets, and a new check/gts-docs command.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added comprehensive validator README, usage examples, commands, and integrated docs into existing guides.\n\n* **Tests / CI**\n  * Unit tests for validator logic and CI wiring to include validator checks.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected expected GTS identifier suffixes in types-registry scenarios.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-16T17:00:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T12:54:11Z","closed_at":"2026-01-20T12:54:11Z","merged_at":"2026-01-20T12:54:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"b9b366f10ab497bdc868f66cf06fc19c90ac20a9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"alizid10","id":247960800,"node_id":"U_kgDODseU4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247960800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10","html_url":"https://github.com/alizid10","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a