ub.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n```\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"=== Checking workspace dependencies in root Cargo.toml ===\"\nrg -A 100 '^\\[workspace\\.dependencies\\]' Cargo.toml | grep -E '(^gts|^walkdir|^tempfile|^\\[)' || echo \"Pattern not found or no matches\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Full list of workspace dependencies (first 150 lines) ===\"\nrg -A 150 '^\\[workspace\\.dependencies\\]' Cargo.toml | head -170\n```\n\nLength of output: 4040\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n```\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"=== Workspace members ===\"\nrg -A 100 '^\\[workspace\\]' Cargo.toml | grep -A 50 'members = \\[' | head -60\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Looking for gts crate in workspace ===\"\nfd -t d '^gts$' libs/ crates/ apps/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"No gts directory found in common locations\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Checking if libs/gts exists ===\"\nls -la libs/ 2>/dev/null | grep gts || echo \"No gts in libs/\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Checking all workspace member paths ===\"\nfd -t f '^Cargo\\.toml$' --max-depth 3 | head -30\n```\n\nLength of output: 2849\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n```\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\necho \"=== Check gts-docs-validator actual dependency resolution ===\"\ncat apps/gts-docs-validator/Cargo.toml | grep -A 2 -B 2 'gts\\|walkdir'\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Search for any gts = entries in workspace.dependencies (wider search) ===\"\nrg '^gts\\s*=' Cargo.toml || echo \"No 'gts =' line found\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Search for walkdir in workspace.dependencies ===\"\nrg '^walkdir\\s*=' Cargo.toml || echo \"No 'walkdir =' line found\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Check if modkit exports gts publicly ===\"\nrg -A 5 'pub mod gts|pub use.*gts' libs/modkit/src/lib.rs || echo \"No public gts export found in modkit\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Check modkit Cargo.toml for gts or walkdir dependencies ===\"\nrg 'gts|walkdir' libs/modkit/Cargo.toml || echo \"No gts or walkdir found in modkit\"\n```\n\nLength of output: 916\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n`@yoskini`, you're absolutely right! I apologize for the confusion. All three dependencies are actually **present** in the workspace dependencies:\n\n- `gts = { git = \"https://github.com/globaltypesystem/gts-rust.git\", tag = \"v0.7.7\" }`\n- `walkdir = \"2.5\"`\n- `tempfile = \"3\"`\n\nMy initial analysis was incorrect—the dependencies are properly configured, which is why your `cargo check` succeeded. The crate is correctly set up and ready to go. Thank you for verifying! ✅\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧠 Learnings used</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/Cargo.toml : In `Cargo.toml` for lint crates, reference common workspace dependencies (`clippy_utils`, `dylint_linting`, `lint_utils`) using `.workspace = true` to avoid duplication\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/Cargo.toml : Register new lint crates by adding them to the `members` list in the workspace root `Cargo.toml`\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/Cargo.toml : Define example targets in lint crate `Cargo.toml` with `[[example]]` sections for each UI test case\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/src/lib.r