ils>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nA build script (`modules/system/api_gateway/build.rs`) was updated to pin Stoplight Elements via a new `STOPLIGHT_ELEMENTS_VERSION` constant, replace `@latest` in asset URLs with versioned URLs, add an early return when `embed_elements` feature is disabled, and adjust download/error handling for reproducible builds.\n\n## Changes\n\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Build script version pinning & control flow** <br> `modules/system/api_gateway/build.rs` | Added `STOPLIGHT_ELEMENTS_VERSION` constant; replaced hard-coded `@latest` URLs for `web_components.min.js` and `styles.min.css` with formatted versioned URLs; added `cargo:rerun-if-env-changed` for `CARGO_FEATURE_EMBED_ELEMENTS`; early return when `embed_elements` feature is not enabled; create `assets/elements` dir with error handling; updated download call to use `url.as_str()` and adjusted error messages/examples to include the dynamic URL. |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~10 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐇 I hop through bytes and tidy threads,  \n> > Replacing \"latest\" with pinned-up threads.  \n> > A constant snug, no drifting tide,  \n> > Builds sleep safe, versioned, and wide.  \n> > 🌿\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 2 | ❌ 1</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ Failed checks (1 warning)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status     | Explanation                                                                          | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :----------------: | :--------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ⚠️ Warning | Docstring coverage is 0.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (2 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name    | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| :---------------: | :------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                               |\n|    Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title 'Freeze stoplight frontend deps' accurately summarizes the main change: pinning STOPLIGHT_ELEMENTS_VERSION to enforce reproducible builds and versioning frontend dependencies. |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>✨ Finishing touches</summary>\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"7962f53c-55bc-4827-bfbf-6a18da830691\"} --> 📝 Generate docstrings\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3759754854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"clien