==\"\ngit status --short 2>/dev/null | grep -E '\\.(min\\.js|min\\.css)' || echo \"No minified files in git status\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 323\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\n# View the .gitignore file with full context around lines 38-39\necho \"=== Full .gitignore context (lines 30-50) ===\"\nsed -n '30,50p' .gitignore\n\necho -e \"\\n=== Git status of styles.min.css ===\"\ngit status modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css 2>/dev/null || echo \"File status check\"\n\necho -e \"\\n=== Git history for styles.min.css (last 3 commits) ===\"\ngit log --oneline -n 3 -- modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css 2>/dev/null || echo \"No history found\"\n\necho -e \"\\n=== Check if styles.min.css is in current PR changes ===\"\ngit diff HEAD -- modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css 2>/dev/null | head -20 || echo \"No diff found\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 540\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Global patterns will cause currently tracked `styles.min.css` to be ignored.**\n\nThe patterns `*.min.js` and `*.min.css` at lines 38-39 will match the existing tracked file `modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css`. While this file won't be deleted, any future changes to it will be ignored by git.\n\nThe PR description mentions \"remove web-components.min.js\" but that file doesn't exist in the repository. Instead, these global patterns will affect the tracked `styles.min.css` file.\n\nIf this file should remain version-controlled and actively maintained, either:\n1. Scope the patterns to specific directories: `/dist/*.min.js`, `/build/*.min.css`\n2. Add an exception: `!modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css`\n3. Explicitly document the intent if all minified files should be ignored going forward\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn @.gitignore around lines 38 - 39, The global .gitignore patterns '*.min.js'\nand '*.min.css' will cause the tracked file\nmodules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css to be ignored for\nfuture changes; update .gitignore to either scope the patterns (e.g. limit to\n/dist/ or /build/), add an explicit exception for the tracked file\n(!modules/system/api_gateway/assets/elements/styles.min.css), or remove the\nglobal '*.min.css'/'*.min.js' entries and replace them with directory-scoped\npatterns so that styles.min.css remains version-controlled and editable.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit d4059a1","created_at":"2026-01-16T12:12:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T10:40:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/262#discussion_r2698291630","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/262","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2698291630"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/262#discussion_r2698291630"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/262"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2698291630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":38,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":39,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2704215820","pull_request_review_id":3677438788,"id":2704215820,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hLw8M","diff_hunk":"@@ -5,6 +5,12 @@ use std::fs;\n use std::io::Write;\n use std::path::Path;\n \n+// Using pinned version instead of @latest to ensure reproducible builds.\