nts` and `@stoplight/elements-core`. [1][2]\n\nSources\n[1] https://www.npmjs.com/package/%40stoplight/elements/v/9.0.6\n[2] https://www.npmjs.com/package/%40stoplight/elements-core/v/9.0.6\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Fix the invalid pinned Stoplight Elements version.**\n\nVersion `9.0.15` does not exist on the npm registry — the latest published version is `9.0.6`. This will cause builds to fail when attempting to download the non-existent version from unpkg. Update line 12 to use a valid version (e.g., `9.0.6` or another existing release).\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/api_gateway/build.rs` around lines 8 - 12, The pinned\nStoplight Elements version is invalid and causes download failures; update the\nconst STOPLIGHT_ELEMENTS_VERSION in build.rs (the constant named\nSTOPLIGHT_ELEMENTS_VERSION) to a valid published release like \"9.0.6\" (or\nanother existing npm version) so the build fetches an existing package from\nunpkg.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-19T10:44:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T10:50:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/262#discussion_r2704215820","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/262","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2704215820"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/262#discussion_r2704215820"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/262"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2704215820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":8,"original_start_line":8,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":12,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_associa