yperspot\n\nLength of output: 773\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**The `guidelines/DNA/` directory exists but is currently empty.**\n\nThe directory structure matches the documentation—all referenced paths (`guidelines/DNA/`, `NEW_MODULE.md`, `SECURITY.md`) exist in the repository. However, the `guidelines/DNA/` directory is empty despite being documented as containing \"Development standards.\" Consider either updating the documentation if this directory is intentionally a placeholder, or adding the relevant REST API design patterns and architectural principles documentation to it.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn @.fdd-adapter/specs/project-structure.md around lines 97 - 101, The docs\nreference a populated guidelines/DNA/ directory but that folder is empty; update\nthe repo so the documentation and filesystem match by either adding the missing\ndevelopment standards files (e.g., REST API design patterns, architectural\nprinciples) into guidelines/DNA/ or change the spec to mark guidelines/DNA/ as\nintentionally empty/placeholder; ensure references like NEW_MODULE.md and\nSECURITY.md remain correct and update any mentions in project-structure.md to\npoint to the new/adjusted location or note the placeholder status.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-16T17:53:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T17:53:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/258#discussion_r2699450792","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/258","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2699450792"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/258#discussion_r2699450792"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/258"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfa