iles:**\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/conventions.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/project-structure.md`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:14.316Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:14.316Z\nLearning: Always follow the guidelines specified in `@/guidelines/README.md`\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/conventions.md`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/ui/*.rs : For struct/enum/function multiline spans in UI tests, place error comments on the first line of the item declaration (e.g., `pub struct Name`), not on the `#[derive(...)]` attribute line\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/conventions.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/architectural-lints.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/spec.md : Use `## ADDED|MODIFIED|REMOVED|RENAMED Requirements` section headers in delta spec files with at least one `#### Scenario:` per requirement\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/testing.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/project-structure.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/domain-model.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/architectural-lints.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/patterns.md`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/module-creation.md`\n- `FDD-Adapter/specs/api-contracts.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTi