by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features / Refactor**\n  * Introduced a separate public SDK for the nodes registry and renamed its client interface, updating the public API surface.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated REST endpoint paths and usage examples.\n  * Clarified gateway/module dependency guidance and that plugins are resolved indirectly.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Reorganized module layout into distinct SDK and implementation crates.\n  * Adjusted dependency paths and features for supporting crates.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-15T23:47:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T08:10:33Z","closed_at":"2026-01-16T08:10:33Z","merged_at":"2026-01-16T08:10:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"a7f2527cb9910751b6f5a6b4664039ffc8e37513","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url