yBs7f9XfZ","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T23:47:50Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T00:26:53Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR splits the nodes_registry into two crates: a new public SDK crate `nodes_registry-sdk` and an implementation crate `nodes_registry`. The client trait was renamed from `NodesRegistryApi` → `NodesRegistryClient`, imports and re-exports updated, workspace members and dependency paths adjusted, and minor dependency feature flags changed.\n\n## Changes\n\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Workspace & root manifests** <br> `Cargo.toml`, `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml` | Replaced workspace member `modules/system/nodes_registry` with `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry` and `.../nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk`; updated dependent path in `apps/hyperspot-server` to the nested `nodes_registry` crate. |\n| **New SDK crate** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/{lib.rs,api.rs,error.rs}` | Added `nodes_registry-sdk` crate: defines `NodesRegistryClient` trait, `NodesRegistryError` enum, and re-exports client/error types as the public API surface. |\n| **Implementation crate manifests** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/Cargo.toml` | Added dependency on `../nodes_registry-sdk`; adjusted relative paths for other workspace deps. |\n| **Implementation code (imports & re-exports)** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/{lib.rs,module.rs,gateways/local.rs,api/rest/mapper.rs,domain/{error.rs,node_storage.rs,service.rs}}` | Switched usages/imports from internal `contract` types/traits to `nodes_registry_sdk` types and trait `NodesRegistryClient`; removed local `contract` error type and re-exported SDK types at crate root; added `From<DomainError> for nodes_registry_sdk::NodesRegistryError`. |\n| **Tests** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/tests/*_tests.rs` | Updated test imports to use crate-root exports (`nodes_registry::...`) instead of `nodes_registry::contract::...`. |\n| **Removed local contract error** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/src/contract/error.rs` | Deleted `NodesRegistryError` enum and its `From<DomainError>` mapping (moved/added in SDK/implementation conversions). |\n| **Dependency feature flags** <br> `libs/modkit-node-info/Cargo.toml` | Added chrono feature `\"clock\"` and uuid feature `\"v4\"` (now `[\"v4\",\"v5\"]`). |\n| **Documentation & guides** <br> `modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md`, `docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md`, `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md` | Updated examples/imports to `nodes_registry_sdk` and `NodesRegistryClient`, adjusted gateway deps examples to not list plugins directly, and updated example paths to nested `nodes_registry` crate and REST path `/nodes-registry/v1/nodes`. |\n\n## Sequence Diagram(s)\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Module\n    participant ClientHub\n    participant Impl as NodesRegistryImpl\n    participant SDK as nodes_registry-sdk\n\n    Module->>ClientHub: register::<dyn SDK.NodesRegistryClient>(api)\n    note right of ClientHub: stores Arc<dyn NodesRegistryClient>\n    Module->>ClientHub: get::<dyn SDK.NodesRegistryClient>()\n    ClientHub-->>Module: Arc<dyn NodesRegistryClient>\n    Module->>SDK: call trait method (e.g., get_node)\n    SDK->>Impl: forwarded to implementation (impl NodesRegistryClient)\n    Impl-->>SDK: result / NodesRegistryError\n    SDK-->>Module: return result\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 4 (Complex) | ⏱️ ~40 minutes\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- Bechma\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰  \n> A burrow split to make things clear,  \n> SDK springs forward, implementation near,  \n> NodesRegistryClient hops into place,  \n> Paths updated, imports embrace,  \n> Chrono ticks and UUIDs race.\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 2 | ❌ 1</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ Failed checks (1 warning)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status     | Explanation                                                                           | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :----------------: | :--------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ⚠️ Warning | Docstring coverage is 28.57% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (2 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name    | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| :---------------: | :------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n|    Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title accurately describes the main refactoring: extracting the public contract into a new nodes_registry-sdk crate and renaming NodesRegistryApi to NodesRegistryClient, which are the primary structural changes visible across all modified files. |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>✨ Finishing touches</summary>\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"7962f53c-55bc-4827-bfbf-6a18da830691\"} --> 📝 Generate docstrings\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3757406169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"pe