e all cache\n - **Merging**: System capabilities merge with custom ones (custom overrides)\n \n-## Custom Capabilities API\n+## Custom Capabilities\n \n-Modules can report custom software capabilities:\n-\n-```rust\n-use nodes_registry::contract::client::NodesRegistryApi;\n-\n-// Set custom capabilities (e.g., LM Studio presence)\n-let lm_studio_caps = vec![\n-    SysCap {\n-        key: \"software:lm-studio\".to_string(),\n-        category: \"software\".to_string(),\n-        name: \"lm-studio\".to_string(),\n-        display_name: \"LM Studio\".to_string(),\n-        present: true,\n-        version: Some(\"0.2.9\".to_string()),\n-        amount: None,\n-        amount_dimension: None,\n-        details: Some(\"Local LLM server\".to_string()),\n-        cache_ttl_secs: 60,\n-        fetched_at_secs: chrono::Utc::now().timestamp(),\n-    }\n-];\n-\n-client.set_custom_syscap(node_id, lm_studio_caps).await?;\n-\n-// Remove custom capabilities\n-client.remove_custom_syscap(node_id, vec![\"software:lm-studio\".to_string()]).await?;\n-\n-// Clear all custom capabilities\n-client.clear_custom_syscap(node_id).await?;\n-```\n+Custom software capabilities are stored by the module and merged into syscap responses.","path":"modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md","commit_id":"d73807905ddd4bc29a64b22ceded70012ecedfdc","original_commit_id":"d73807905ddd4bc29a64b22ceded70012ecedfdc","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n\n**Consider adding basic API guidance for custom capabilities.**\n\nThe Custom Capabilities section is very brief and describes what happens but not how developers can add custom capabilities from their modules. While the PR objectives correctly remove plugin-specific examples, consider adding a generic code snippet showing the API pattern for setting custom capabilities.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Example improvement</summary>\n\nConsider adding something like:\n\n```markdown\n## Custom Capabilities\n\nModules can register custom software capabilities that are merged into syscap responses:\n\n```rust\n// Example: Adding a custom capability from your module\nlet client = ctx.client_hub().get::<dyn NodesRegistryClient>()?;\n// API for setting custom capabilities would be shown here\n```\n\nCustom capabilities are merged with system capabilities, with custom entries taking precedence for duplicate keys.\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md` around lines 227 - 229, Add a short\nhow-to showing the API pattern for registering custom capabilities: describe\nobtaining the client via ctx.client_hub().get::<dyn NodesRegistryClient>() and\ncall the module API (e.g., set_custom_capabilities or\nregister_custom_capabilities) with your capability map/struct; include a brief\nnote that custom capabilities are merged into syscap responses and that custom\nkeys override system keys on conflict. Reference the client lookup\n(ctx.client_hub(), NodesRegistryClient) and the capability-setter method name so\nreaders can find the implementation in the codebase.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-15T23:50:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T23:50:31Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/256#discussion_r2696371367","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/256","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2696371367"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/256#discussion_r2696371367"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/256"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2696371367/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":227,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":229,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":152,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[{"id":3668139021,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOPaLyBs7ao1wN","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/