lved indirectly via GTS.\n #[modkit::module(\n     name = \"my_gateway\",\n-    deps = [\"types_registry\"],  // Gateway depends on the types_registry and any other required modules, but not on plugins. Plugins are resolved indirectly via GTS.\n+    deps = [\"types_registry\"],\n     capabilities = [rest]\n )]\n````\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n`711-717`: **Inconsistent comment placement between examples.**\n\nThis example (lines 711-714) places the explanatory comment on a separate line above the module attribute, which is more readable than the inline comment approach used in the earlier example (line 320). The documentation would benefit from consistent formatting across all code examples.\n\nConsider updating the first example (lines 318-322) to match this cleaner style.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/error.rs (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1-18`: **LGTM! Well-designed SDK error type.**\n\nThe error type correctly follows SDK design principles:\n- No `serde` derives (transport-agnostic)\n- Includes `Clone`, `PartialEq`, `Eq` for testability\n- `Internal` variant intentionally hides implementation details\n\n\n\n\n\nConsider adding convenience constructors for ergonomic error creation, consistent with other SDK modules in the codebase:\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Optional: Add convenience constructors</summary>\n\n```diff\n #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, thiserror::Error)]\n pub enum NodesRegistryError {\n     // ... variants ...\n }\n+\n+impl NodesRegistryError {\n+    pub fn not_found(id: uuid::Uuid) -> Self {\n+        Self::NodeNotFound(id)\n+    }\n+\n+    pub fn validation(msg: impl Into<String>) -> Self {\n+        Self::Validation(msg.into())\n+    }\n+\n+    pub fn internal() -> Self {\n+        Self::Internal\n+    }\n+}\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/domain/error.rs (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`42-53`: **Preserve internal error detail before mapping.**\n\n`DomainError::Internal(String)` collapses to `NodesRegistryError::Internal`, so the message is dropped. Consider logging the original message before converting so diagnostics aren’t lost.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📜 Review details</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Pro\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between ed0d1dad6e96cecd9d3d12824003d1fddd755bab and d73807905ddd4bc29a64b22ceded70012ecedfdc.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⛔ Files ignored due to path filters (1)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.lock` is excluded by `!**/*.lock`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (32)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.toml`\n* `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml`\n* `docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md`\n* `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md`\n* `libs/modkit-node-info/Cargo.toml`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/Cargo.toml`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/api.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/error.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/lib.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/Cargo.toml`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/mod.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/dto.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/error.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/handlers.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/mapper.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/mod.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/api/rest/routes.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/config.rs`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/domain/error.rs`\n* `