 but this should be updated to `nodes_registry_sdk::NodesRegistryClient` to match the SDK restructuring and align with the \"Usage from Other Modules\" section at line 264.\n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>📝 Suggested fix</summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n>  ## Custom Capabilities\n> \n>  Modules can report custom software capabilities:\n> \n>  ```rust\n> -use nodes_registry::contract::client::NodesRegistryApi;\n> +use nodes_registry_sdk::NodesRegistryClient;\n> \n>  // Set custom capabilities (e.g., LM Studio presence)\n> ```\n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/src/error.rs (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`2-3`: **Consider `#[non_exhaustive]` for the public SDK error enum.**  \nThis keeps future variant additions from being a breaking change for downstream exhaustive matches.\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Proposed change</summary>\n\n```diff\n-#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, thiserror::Error)]\n+#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, thiserror::Error)]\n+#[non_exhaustive]\n pub enum NodesRegistryError {\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📜 Review details</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Pro\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between d73807905ddd4bc29a64b22ceded70012ecedfdc and cefc6b0f1cd71428b99dddf63272ff51ec571229.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⛔ Files ignored due to path filters (1)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.lock` is excluded by `!**/*.lock`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (32)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.toml`\n* `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml`\n* `docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md`\n* `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md`\n* `libs/modkit-node-info/Cargo.toml`\n* `modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md`