project's `@/lib/modkit`* unified system\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/Cargo.toml`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Prefer modifying existing specs over creating duplicates; always check if capability already exists before scaffolding\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/system/nodes_registry/README.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.902Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/src/lib.rs : Use `is_in_contract_module_ast()` helper from `lint_utils` crate to check if an AST item is in a contract/ directory\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/src/lib.rs`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/spec.md : When using MODIFIED Requirements, paste the full, updated requirement content (header + all scenarios); partial deltas will drop previous details at archive time\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⏰ Context from checks skipped due to timeout of 90000ms. You can increase the timeout in your CodeRabbit configuration to a maximum of 15 minutes (900000ms). (10)</summary>\n\n* GitHub Check: users_info integration (Postgres)\n* GitHub Check: modkit-db integration (backend=sqlite)\n* GitHub Check: Run Dylint Lints\n* GitHub Check: