cussion","discussion_comment","fork","gollum","issues","issue_comment","label","merge_group","milestone","page_build","public","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","registry_package","release","repository","repository_dispatch","status","watch","workflow_dispatch","workflow_run"]}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3818363309","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#issuecomment-3818363309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/253","id":3818363309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7jl5mt","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T15:20:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T15:20:37Z","body":"> @Bechma Done — implemented `#[domain_model]` macro with `DomainSafe` trait for compile-time enforcement.\r\n\r\nI review the PR and I got some questions that I prefer to collect them all in a single comment:\r\n- The implementation is approaching more what I wanted. However, I liked more the andrew approach for the api_dto, check https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/247/changes#diff-bae20ad91a8616f1d8ef7c78e186a4f77a4d1a532e97bc2f28ee259187df45be and https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/247/changes#diff-07b38e9d9cdca7e897acfcdc7fe54e4793a13a9e4f73883d57818689259d184c:\r\n  - Validation\r\n  - Generation\r\n- There are two traits, why? What we want is to \"flag\" that the struct passed through our custom validation through the derive macro and our generation phase, to not incur in custom implementation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3818363309/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3819492373","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#issuecomment-3819492373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/253","id":3819492373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7jqNQV","user":{"login":"KvizadSaderah","id":14391797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzkxNzk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14391797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah","html_url":"https://github.com/KvizadSaderah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KvizadSaderah/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T18:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T18:29:45Z","body":"@Bechma Regarding the two traits question:\n\nCurrent design rationale:\n- DomainSafe is needed for blanket impls on types that are not Send+Sync (like &str, &T)\n- DomainModel = DomainSafe + Send + Sync — for actual domain entities\n\nTo align with api_dto pattern, there are two options:\n\nOption A: Add flags like api_dto\n#[domain_model(entity)] for entities with identity\n#[domain_model(value_object)] for immutable value objects\nThis gives proper validation in macro (like validate_flags) plus we hide DomainSafe with doc(hidden).\n\nOption B: Simplify without flags\nKeep one trait, make DomainSafe doc(hidden), validation stays via trait bounds.\n\nWhich approach would you prefer?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3819492373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3822441417","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#issuecomment-3822441417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/253","id":3822441417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7j1dPJ","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-ac