mmary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/file_parser/src/infra/parsers/xlsx_parser.rs` around lines 180 - 194,\nReplace the debug-format default filename and incorporate the content_type hint\ninto format detection: instead of building default_filename with\nformat!(\"unknown.{:?}\", ExcelFormat::default()), generate a proper lowercase\nextension using the ExcelFormat API (e.g., ExcelFormat::default().extension() or\nto_string().to_lowercase()) so the default becomes \"unknown.xlsx\" not\n\"unknown.Xlsx\"; then include the provided content_type (the _content_type\nparameter) as an intermediate hint in the detection chain so the format\nresolution becomes ExcelFormat::from_magic_bytes(bytes.as_ref()).or_else(||\ncontent_type.and_then(|ct| ExcelFormat::from_mime_type(ct).ok())).or_else(||\nExcelFormat::from_filename(&filename).ok())..., and remove the unused underscore\nprefix if you use the parameter.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commits 0b9406c to 2f44290","created_at":"2026-02-02T17:01:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:16:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2755353390","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2755353390"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2755353390"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2755353390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":180,"original_start_line":180,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":194,"original_line":194,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CO