eading which violates MD001; change the heading level for \"What it does\"\nfrom ### to ## so it is H2 and follows the H1 (update the heading text \"What it\ndoes\" in the README for\ndylint_lints/de03_domain_layer/de0308_no_http_in_domain/README.md).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-10T21:50:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T21:50:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2790460383","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2790460383"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2790460383"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2790460383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":3,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":5,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2800636080","pull_request_review_id":3793138970,"id":2800636080,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6m7lCw","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,128 @@\n+#![allow(clippy::unwrap_used, clippy::expect_used)]\n+\n+//! Compile-fail tests for `domain_model` macro enforcement.\n+//!\n+//! These tests verify that the `domain_model` macro correctly rejects\n+//! types with infrastructure dependencies at compile time.\n+\n+#[test]\n+#[cfg(not(coverage_nightly))]\n+#[ignore = \"TODO: Enable after generating .stderr files\"]\n+fn domain_model_compile_fail_tests() {\n+    // On MinGW (windows-gnu), native deps 