02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/src/lib.rs : Use `ui_test` testing macro when all tests have no external dependencies and many similar test cases exist\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Ensure all tests pass with `cargo test --lib` before adding new lint crate to workspace and pushing changes\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/ui/*.stderr : Generate `.stderr` files by running tests with `cargo test --lib ui_examples`, copying normalized stderr output, and using `$DIR/` placeholder for file paths with exact line number matching\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/ui/*.rs : Include test cases with no violations (resulting in empty `.stderr` files) alongside violation test cases\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/ui/*.rs : Create UI test files in `ui/` directory with corresponding `.stderr` files containing expected lint output\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/src/lib.rs : Include `test_comment_annotations_match_stderr` unit test in every lint to validate that test comments match actual lint behavior in `.stderr` files\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/ui/main.{rs,stderr} : Remove empty `main.rs` and `main.stderr` test files after initialization\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-09T12:27:51.217Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/*/ui/*.rs : Place test comment annotations (`// Should trigger DEXXX` or `// Should not trigger DEXXX`) on the line immediately before where the error is reported, not on the attribute line\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: cyberfabric/cyberfabric-core PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-02-10T18:54:33.294Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/*.md : In spec delta files, use ADDED for new orthogonal capabilities, MODIFIED for behavior changes of existing requirements, and RENAMED for name-only changes\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-02-12T19:16:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T19:16:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2800638315","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2800638315"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/253#discussion_r2800638315"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/253"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2800638315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":17,"original_start_line":8,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":29,"original_line":21,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2755353379,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":21,"position":29,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[{"id":3666988457,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOPaLyBs7ak