mary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🪛 markdownlint-cli2 (0.18.1)</summary>\n\n32-32: Bare URL used\n\n(MD034, no-bare-urls)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md` at line 32, The bare URL on the \"**Interactive\ndocs:**\" line should be formatted as either an angle-bracketed URL or a proper\nMarkdown link; update the line in QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md (the \"**Interactive\ndocs:**\" entry) to use either \"<http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs>\" or \"[Interactive\ndocs](http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs)\" so the link renders correctly.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 0779148","created_at":"2026-01-15T16:57:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:04:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2695210944","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2695210944"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2695210944"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2695210944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":32,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":32,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2695210962","pull_request_review_id":3666650006,"id":2695210962,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6gpafS","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs\n+\n+---\n+\n+## File Parser\n+\n+Parses PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, images, and more into structured document blocks.\n+\n+```bash\n+# List supported file types\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/info | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"supported_extensions\": {\n+        \"plain_text\": [\"txt\", \"log\", \"md\"],\n+        \"html\": [\"html\", \"htm\"],\n+        \"pdf\": [\"pdf\"],\n+        \"docx\": [\"docx\"],\n+        \"image\": [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"webp\", \"gif\"],\n+        \"generic_stub\": [\"doc\", \"rtf\", \"odt\", \"xls\", \"xlsx\", \"ppt\", \"pptx\"]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Parse a local file\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Parse a file from URL\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n\n**Use a valid example URL or add a note for users to replace it.**\n\nThe example URL `https://example.com/document.pdf` is unlikely to exist or return a valid PDF document. Users attempting to run this command as-is will encounter errors.\n\n\nConsider using a real publicly available PDF URL or adding a note like:\n\n```diff\n # Parse a file from URL\n curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n-  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"<REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PDF_URL>\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n```\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\ncurl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"url\": \"<REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PDF_URL>\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md` around lines 66 - 68, Replace the placeholder URL\nin the curl example in QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md (the POST to\n/file-parser/v1/parse-url) with a real, publicly accessible PDF URL or add a\nconcise note immediately above the example telling users to replace\n\"https://example.com/document.pdf\" with a valid PDF URL; ensure the example\ncommand remains runnable and mention that the URL must point to a downloadable\nPDF.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:triton:puma -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-15T16:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:04:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2695210962","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2695210962"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2695210962"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2695210962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":66,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":68,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":68,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697944863","pull_request_review_id":3670142351,"id":2697944863,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6gz18f","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'd suggest to add `make quickstart` alias as well, because the list of 'features' will be changing over time, and it's simpler to maintain it consistenty inside Makefile for quickstart and other targets","created_at":"2026-01-16T10:34:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T11:44:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2697944863","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697944863"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2697944863"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697944863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":10,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":10,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697958934","pull_request_review_id":3670142351,"id":2697958934,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6gz5YW","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs\n+\n+---\n+\n+## File Parser\n+\n+Parses PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, images, and more into structured document blocks.\n+\n+```bash\n+# List supported file types\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/info | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"supported_extensions\": {\n+        \"plain_text\": [\"txt\", \"log\", \"md\"],\n+        \"html\": [\"html\", \"htm\"],\n+        \"pdf\": [\"pdf\"],\n+        \"docx\": [\"docx\"],\n+        \"image\": [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"webp\", \"gif\"],\n+        \"generic_stub\": [\"doc\", \"rtf\", \"odt\", \"xls\", \"xlsx\", \"ppt\", \"pptx\"]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Parse a local file\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Parse a file from URL\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Upload and parse a file\n+echo \"Hello, HyperSpot!\" > /tmp/test.txt\n+curl -s -X POST \"http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/upload?filename=test.txt\" \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/octet-stream\" \\\n+  --data-binary @/tmp/test.txt | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"document\": {\n+        \"id\": \"019bc231-fcfd-7df3-a49c-82174973ec44\",\n+        \"title\": \"test.txt\",\n+        \"meta\": {\n+            \"source\": {\"type\": \"uploaded\", \"original_name\": \"test.txt\"},\n+            \"content_type\": \"text/plain\"\n+        },\n+        \"blocks\": [\n+            {\n+                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n+                \"inlines\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Hello, HyperSpot!\", \"style\": {}}]\n+            }\n+        ]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Stream parsed content as Markdown\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local/markdown \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}'\n+```\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Nodes Registry","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I like the idea of showing sample APIs. Did you consider to:\n1. Keep such quickstart.md per module\n2. Refer to it from this QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md\n\nOr even make an automation to compile it...\n\nIt would help to keep module specific content within the modules folders, not to spread it across different parts of the project, so it would be simpler for humans/LLMs to understand how to add a new module end-to-end \n\nAnd in any case, we need to update MODULES guidelines to mention we need to write/update quickstart guidelines","created_at":"2026-01-16T10:38:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T11:44:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2697958934","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697958934"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2697958934"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2697958934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":106,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":106,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705554826","pull_request_review_id":3679015835,"id":2705554826,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hQ32K","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"yoskini","id":20127030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI3MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20127030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini","html_url":"https://github.com/yoskini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Done","created_at":"2026-01-19T17:01:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:01:36Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705554826","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705554826"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705554826"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705554826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":10,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2697944863,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":10,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705555440","pull_request_review_id":3679016569,"id":2705555440,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hQ3_w","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs\n+\n+---\n+\n+## File Parser\n+\n+Parses PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, images, and more into structured document blocks.\n+\n+```bash\n+# List supported file types\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/info | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"supported_extensions\": {\n+        \"plain_text\": [\"txt\", \"log\", \"md\"],\n+        \"html\": [\"html\", \"htm\"],\n+        \"pdf\": [\"pdf\"],\n+        \"docx\": [\"docx\"],\n+        \"image\": [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"webp\", \"gif\"],\n+        \"generic_stub\": [\"doc\", \"rtf\", \"odt\", \"xls\", \"xlsx\", \"ppt\", \"pptx\"]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Parse a local file\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Parse a file from URL\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Upload and parse a file\n+echo \"Hello, HyperSpot!\" > /tmp/test.txt\n+curl -s -X POST \"http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/upload?filename=test.txt\" \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/octet-stream\" \\\n+  --data-binary @/tmp/test.txt | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"document\": {\n+        \"id\": \"019bc231-fcfd-7df3-a49c-82174973ec44\",\n+        \"title\": \"test.txt\",\n+        \"meta\": {\n+            \"source\": {\"type\": \"uploaded\", \"original_name\": \"test.txt\"},\n+            \"content_type\": \"text/plain\"\n+        },\n+        \"blocks\": [\n+            {\n+                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n+                \"inlines\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Hello, HyperSpot!\", \"style\": {}}]\n+            }\n+        ]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Stream parsed content as Markdown\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local/markdown \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}'\n+```\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Nodes Registry","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"yoskini","id":20127030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI3MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20127030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini","html_url":"https://github.com/yoskini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Done","created_at":"2026-01-19T17:01:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:01:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705555440","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705555440"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705555440"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705555440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":106,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2697958934,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":106,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705561625","pull_request_review_id":3679024199,"id":2705561625,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hQ5gZ","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs\n+\n+---\n+\n+## File Parser\n+\n+Parses PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, images, and more into structured document blocks.\n+\n+```bash\n+# List supported file types\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/info | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"supported_extensions\": {\n+        \"plain_text\": [\"txt\", \"log\", \"md\"],\n+        \"html\": [\"html\", \"htm\"],\n+        \"pdf\": [\"pdf\"],\n+        \"docx\": [\"docx\"],\n+        \"image\": [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"webp\", \"gif\"],\n+        \"generic_stub\": [\"doc\", \"rtf\", \"odt\", \"xls\", \"xlsx\", \"ppt\", \"pptx\"]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Parse a local file\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Parse a file from URL\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"yoskini","id":20127030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI3MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20127030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini","html_url":"https://github.com/yoskini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I disagree. The URL is valid and it is designed for examples purpose.","created_at":"2026-01-19T17:04:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:04:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705561625","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705561625"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2705561625"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705561625/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":66,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":68,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2695210962,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":68,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2705562788","pull_request_review_id":3679025781,"id":2705562788,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hQ5yk","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,253 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+cargo run --bin hyperspot-server --features users-info-example,tenant-resolver-example -- --config config/quickstart.yaml run\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs\n+\n+---\n+\n+## File Parser\n+\n+Parses PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, images, and more into structured document blocks.\n+\n+```bash\n+# List supported file types\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/info | python3 -m json.tool\n+```\n+\n+**Output:**\n+```json\n+{\n+    \"supported_extensions\": {\n+        \"plain_text\": [\"txt\", \"log\", \"md\"],\n+        \"html\": [\"html\", \"htm\"],\n+        \"pdf\": [\"pdf\"],\n+        \"docx\": [\"docx\"],\n+        \"image\": [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"jpeg\", \"webp\", \"gif\"],\n+        \"generic_stub\": [\"doc\", \"rtf\", \"odt\", \"xls\", \"xlsx\", \"ppt\", \"pptx\"]\n+    }\n+}\n+```\n+\n+```bash\n+# Parse a local file\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-local \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"file_path\": \"'$PWD'/README.md\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40\n+\n+# Parse a file from URL\n+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8087/file-parser/v1/parse-url \\\n+  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n+  -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/document.pdf\"}' | python3 -m json.tool | head -40","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","original_commit_id":"b32cf10c21eff7840fa4fceab6aaed458bbc26c7","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_ur