le with:\n+\n+1. **Module description** - What the module does\n+2. **Endpoints table** - All endpoints with method and description\n+3. **Curl examples** - Copy-paste commands with sample outputs\n+\n+**Template:**\n+\n+```markdown\n+# <Module Name> - Quickstart\n+\n+<One-line description of what the module does.>\n+\n+## Endpoints\n+\n+| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n+|----------|--------|-------------|\n+| `/<module>/v1/resource` | GET | List resources |\n+| `/<module>/v1/resource/{id}` | GET | Get resource by ID |\n+\n+## Examples\n+\n+### List Resources\n+\n+\\`\\`\\`bash","path":"guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md","commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","original_commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This broke the display","created_at":"2026-01-22T11:22:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T11:26:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2716487511","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyb