pload` | POST | Upload and parse a file |\n+| `/file-parser/v1/parse-local/markdown` | POST | Stream parsed content as Markdown |","path":"modules/file_parser/QUICKSTART.md","commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","original_commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"high chances of getting this outdated... I think it's better to refer to the /docs and leave general information here","created_at":"2026-01-22T11:25:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T11:26:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2716498879","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2716498879"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2716498879"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2716498879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":9,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":13,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":13,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2716501942","pull_request_review_id":3691965434,"id":2716501942,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6h6oe2","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@\n+# Tenant Resolver - Quickstart\n+\n+Multi-tenant hierarchy management. Tenants form a tree structure with parent/child relationships.\n+\n+> **Note:** Requires `make example` (includes `--features tenant-resolver-example`)\n+\n+## Endpoints\n+\n+| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n+|----------|--------|-------------|\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/root` | GET | Get root tenant |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants` | GET | List all tenants |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}` | GET | Get tenant by ID |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}/children` | GET | Get children of a tenant (recursive) |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}/parents` | GET | Get parent chain of a tenant |\n+\n+## Examples\n+\n+### Get Root Tenant\n+\n+```bash\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/tenant-resolver/v1/root | python3 -m json.tool","path":"modules/system/tenant_resolver/QUICKSTART.md","commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","original_commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{