les/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.273Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/spec.md : Use `## ADDED|MODIFIED|REMOVED|RENAMED Requirements` section headers in delta spec files with at least one `#### Scenario:` per requirement\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.273Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/spec.md : When using MODIFIED Requirements, paste the full, updated requirement content (header + all scenarios); partial deltas will drop previous details at archive time\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.273Z\nLearning: Create proposal.md file for all changes that add features, make breaking changes, change architecture/patterns, optimize performance, or update security patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.273Z\nLearning: Create design.md only when the change is cross-cutting, introduces new architecture patterns, adds external dependencies, makes significant data model changes, involves security/performance complexity, or has ambiguity\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-22T13:25:28.490Z\nLearning: Create `design.md` only if the change involves cross-cutting changes, new dependencies, significant data model changes, security/performance complexity, or ambiguity requiring pre-coding decisions\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-22T15:23:13Z","updated_at":"20