ts.\n```\n\nWithout proper code block wrapping, the template will be rendered as a real heading and formatted code blocks, making it unclear that this is a template to copy.\n\n*Spotted by [Graphite Agent](https://app.graphite.com/diamond/?org=hypernetix&ref=ai-review-comment)*<i class='graphite__hidden'><br /><br /><a href=\"https://app.graphite.com/github/pr/hypernetix/hyperspot/251?chatWithGeneratedComment=32d0ab53-1684-41a7-8f3c-cd6f189919ed\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Fix in Graphite\" src=\"https://static.graphite.dev/github-diamond-fix-in-graphite-dark.svg\"></picture></a></i><i class='graphite__hidden'><br /><br />Is this helpful? React 👍 or 👎 to let us know.</i>","created_at":"2026-01-22T15:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T15:25:06Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717387271","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717387271"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717387271"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717387271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":118,"original_start_line":91,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":159,"original_line":112,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":45,"position":68,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717402175","pull_request_revie