oskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"See Graphite comment: it is a template for other modules guidelines","created_at":"2026-01-22T15:39:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T15:39:57Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717451762","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717451762"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717451762"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717451762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":91,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2716490464,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":22,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717669453","pull_request_review_id":3693383876,"id":2717669453,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6h_FhN","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@\n+# Tenant Resolver - Quickstart\n+\n+Multi-tenant hierarchy management. Tenants form a tree structure with parent/child relationships.\n+\n+> **Note:** Requires `make example` (includes `--features tenant-resolver-example`)\n+\n+## Endpoints\n+\n+| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n+|----------|--------|-------------|\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/root` | GET | Get root tenant |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants` | GET | List all tenants |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}` | GET | Get tenant by ID |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}/children` | GET | Get children of a tenant (recursive) |\n+| `/tenant-resolver/v1/tenants/{id}/parents` | GET | Get parent chain of a tenant |\n+\n+## Examples\n+\n+### Get Root Tenant\n+\n+```bash\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/tenant-resolver/v1/root | python3 -m json.tool","path":"modules/system/tenant_resolver/QUICKSTART.md","commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","original_commit_id":"07791482f75d6e35ac8ceeec2daa8ecaf97b8bda","user":{"login":"yoskini","id":20127030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTI3MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20127030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini","html_url":"https://github.com/yoskini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoskini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"done","created_at":"2026-01-22T16:29:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T16:29:44Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717669453","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717669453"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/251#discussion_r2717669453"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/251"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717669453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":22,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2716501942,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":22,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2718008140","pull_request_review_id":3693815147,"id":2718008140,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6iAYNM","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,75 @@\n+# HyperSpot Server - Quickstart Guide\n+\n+Copy-paste commands to explore HyperSpot's API. For project overview, see [README.md](../README.md).\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Start the Server\n+\n+```bash\n+# With example modules (tenant-resolver, users-info)\n+make example\n+\n+# Or minimal (no example modules)\n+make quickstart\n+```\n+\n+Server runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8087`. Open a **new terminal** to test.\n+\n+---\n+\n+## Health & OpenAPI\n+\n+```bash\n+# Health check (JSON)\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/health | python3 -m json.tool\n+# {\"status\": \"healthy\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-15T15:01:02.000Z\"}\n+\n+# Kubernetes liveness probe\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/healthz\n+# ok\n+\n+# OpenAPI 3.1 spec\n+curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8087/openapi.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -50\n+```\n+\n+**Interactive docs:** <http://127.0.0.1:8087/docs>","path":"docs/QUICKSTART_GUIDE.md","commit_id":"2254b82d2a26b1ef7733f5e68e04eecdfaa78ff2","original_commit_id":"2254b82d2a26b1ef7733f5e68e04eecdfaa78ff2","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.gi