 `TypesRegistryClient` in the types registry SDK. These changes propagate across local implementations, bootstrap logic, module definitions, plugins, gateways, and documentation. Additionally, references to `-contracts` crates are updated to `-sdk` crate naming conventions in guidelines.\n\n## Changes\n\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **DirectoryApi → DirectoryClient (SDK & Core)** <br> `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-sdk/src/api.rs`, `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-sdk/src/lib.rs`, `libs/modkit/src/directory.rs`, `libs/modkit/src/lib.rs` | Trait renamed from `DirectoryApi` to `DirectoryClient` in SDK definition; re-exports and public visibility updated across modkit library exports |\n| **DirectoryClient Implementation** <br> `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc/src/client.rs`, `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator/src/server.rs`, `libs/modkit/src/bootstrap/oop.rs`, `modules/system/grpc_hub/src/module.rs` | gRPC client and server implementations updated to implement/use `DirectoryClient`; bootstrap and module initialization paths refactored to use new trait |\n| **LocalDirectoryClient (formerly LocalDirectoryApi)** <br> `libs/modkit/src/directory.rs` | Public struct and implementation renamed; constructor and trait bounds updated; test code refactored |\n| **TypesRegistryApi → TypesRegistryClient (SDK & Core)** <br> `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry-sdk/src/api.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry-sdk/src/lib.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/api/rest/handlers.rs` | Trait renamed in SDK; re-exports updated; internal test constants introduced for schema URLs |\n| **TypesRegistryClient Implementation** <br> `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/domain/local_client.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/lib.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/domain/mod.rs` | Local client implementation trait updated; module registration paths changed; test data refactored to use JSON schema constant |\n| **Plugin Modules (TypesRegistry Client Updates)** <br> `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/plugins/contoso_tr_plugin/src/module.rs`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/plugins/fabrikam_tr_plugin/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/single_tenant_tr_plugin/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/static_tr_plugin/src/module.rs` | Client hub lookups updated to retrieve `dyn TypesRegistryClient`; imports propagated across all tenant resolver plugins |\n| **Gateway & Domain Services** <br> `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/src/domain/service.rs`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/src/domain/service.rs`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/src/module.rs` | Types registry client references updated in gateway service and module initialization |\n| **Example Code (DirectoryClient)** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/wiring.rs` | Function signature updated; DirectoryClient trait bound applied; logging added |\n| **Documentation & Specs** <br> `docs/MODKIT_PLUGINS.md`, `docs/MODKIT_UNIFIED_SYSTEM.md`, `guidelines/NEW_MODULE.md`, `modules/system/types-registry/openspec/specs/types-registry-sdk/spec.md` | Trait names updated in documentation and specifications; `-contracts` crate references changed to `-sdk`; DirectoryApi public trait removed from MODKIT_UNIFIED_SYSTEM docs |\n| **Design & Proposal Docs** <br> `modules/system/types-registry/openspec/changes/archive/2025-12-22-add-types-registry-module/*`, `modules/system/types-registry/openspec/changes/archive/2025-12-22-add-types-registry-sdk/*` | Archived design and proposal documents updated to reflect trait renames and new method signatures (list, get added to TypesRegistryClient) |\n| **Minor Updates** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/src/main.rs`, `libs/modkit-macros/src/lib.rs`, `libs/modkit/src/client_hub.rs`, `libs/modkit/src/runtime/runner.rs`, `examples/modkit/users_info/users_info/src/infra/audit/http_audit_client.rs`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry-sdk/README.md`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/README.md`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/src/infra/storage/in_memory_repo.rs` | Documentation comments and example code updated; test helper constant introduced for schema URLs; HTTPS documentation corrections |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~25 minutes\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- Bechma\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *From Api to Client, the names now flow,*  \n> *Directories dance and registries glow,*  \n> *Traits are renamed with care and grace,*  \n> *SDK crates take contracts' place!*  \n> *A hop, a skip, refactored with cheer! ✨*\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 2 | ❌ 1</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ Failed checks (1 inconclusive)</summary>\n\n|  Check name | Status         | Explanation                                                                                                                                                     | Resolution                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n| :---------: | :------------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Title check | ❓ Inconclusive | The pull request title 'refactor(naming)' is too vague and generic. It does not clearly convey what specific naming changes are being made across the codebase. | Provide a more specific title that describes the main changes, such as 'refactor: rename DirectoryApi to DirectoryClient and TypesRegistryApi to TypesRegistryClient' or 'refactor(naming): standardize API trait naming to Client convention'. |\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (2 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                          |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|  Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                          |\n| Docstring Coverage | ✅ Passed | Docstring coverage is 100.00% which is sufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>✨ Finishing touches</summary>\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"7962f53c-55bc-4827-bfbf-6a18da830691\"} --> 📝 Generate docstrings\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3754877998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart