false},"body":"I would add some prefix like:\n\n```\n- [ ] `ph-1` \n```\n\nfor every scenario and maybe their sub-scenario\nbut we can probably wait for the complete guide from FDD","created_at":"2026-01-26T23:29:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T23:56:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729671279","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729671279"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729671279"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729671279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":7,"original_line":7,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":7,"position":7,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729673190","pull_request_review_id":3708498723,"id":2729673190,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6is4Hm","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+# FileStorage — PRD (LLM Gateway Scope)\n+\n+Media storage for LLM Gateway inputs and outputs.\n+\n+## Scenarios\n+\n+### S1 Fetch Media by URL\n+\n+LLM Gateway fetches uploaded media (images, audio, video, documents) before sending to provider.\n+\n+```mermaid\n+sequenceDiagram\n+    participant GW as LLM Gateway\n+    participant FS as FileStorage\n+\n+    GW->>FS: fetch(url)\n+    FS-->>GW: content + metadata\n+```\n+\n+### S2 Store Generated Content\n+\n+LLM Gateway stores generated media (images, audio, video) and returns URL to consumer.","path":"modules/file_storage/docs/PRD.md","commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","original_commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"what is the link TTL? Forever or it will live as long as chat session lives?","created_at":"2026-01-26T23:30:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T23:56:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729673190","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729673190"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729673190"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729673190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":22,"original_line":22,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":22,"position":22,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729675124","pull_request_review_id":3708498723,"id":2729675124,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6is4l0","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+# FileStorage — PRD (LLM Gateway Scope)\n+\n+Media storage for LLM Gateway inputs and outputs.\n+\n+## Scenarios\n+\n+### S1 Fetch Media by URL\n+\n+LLM Gateway fetches uploaded media (images, audio, video, documents) before sending to provider.\n+\n+```mermaid\n+sequenceDiagram\n+    participant GW as LLM Gateway\n+    participant FS as FileStorage\n+\n+    GW->>FS: fetch(url)\n+    FS-->>GW: content + metadata\n+```\n+\n+### S2 Store Generated Content\n+\n+LLM Gateway stores generated media (images, audio, video) and returns URL to consumer.\n+\n+```mermaid\n+sequenceDiagram\n+    participant GW as LLM Gateway\n+    participant FS as FileStorage\n+\n+    GW->>FS: store(content, metadata)\n+    FS-->>GW: url\n+```\n+\n+### S3 Get Metadata\n+\n+LLM Gateway checks file size before processing.\n+\n+```mermaid\n+sequenceDiagram\n+    participant GW as LLM Gateway\n+    participant FS as FileStorage\n+\n+    GW->>FS: get_metadata(url)\n+    FS-->>GW: { size, mime_type }\n+```\n+","path":"modules/file_storage/docs/PRD.md","commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","original_commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"What about file deletion? will it be deleted automatically by a retention job? If yes, let's add a scenario (say as `ph-2`, not `ph-1`)","created_at":"2026-01-26T23:30:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T23:56:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729675124","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729675124"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729675124"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729675124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":45,"original_line":45,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":45,"position":45,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729677011","pull_request_review_id":3708498723,"id":2729677011,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6is5DT","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+# FileStorage — PRD (LLM Gateway Scope)\n+\n+Media storage for LLM Gateway inputs and outputs.\n+\n+## Scenarios\n+\n+### S1 Fetch Media by URL\n+\n+LLM Gateway fetches uploaded media (images, audio, video, documents) before sending to provider.\n+\n+```mermaid\n+sequenceDiagram\n+    participant GW as LLM Gateway\n+    participant FS as FileStorage\n+\n+    GW->>FS: fetch(url)","path":"modules/file_storage/docs/PRD.md","commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","original_commit_id":"10ead9a75b24501956b240af80221e57ccc0c971","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Not sure what role is required, and what is overall access model. Who has access to the file? Will it be a part of resource group?","created_at":"2026-01-26T23:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T23:56:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729677011","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729677011"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/245#discussion_r2729677011"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/245"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729677011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"