ull request overview\n\nThis PR fixes the README documentation and enhances health check endpoints by adding a new `/healthz` endpoint for simple liveness probes while keeping the existing `/health` endpoint for detailed JSON responses.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `/healthz` endpoint in `rest_prepare` method that returns a simple \"ok\" response for Kubernetes-style liveness probes\n- Updated README with documentation for both health check endpoints, clarifying their different purposes\n- Updated debug log message to reflect the addition of multiple health check endpoints\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 2 out of 2 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| modules/system/api_gateway/src/module.rs | Added `/healthz` endpoint alongside existing `/health` endpoint and updated debug logging |\n| README.md | Added documentation for the new `/healthz` endpoint and clarified the purpose of `/health` |\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/hypernetix/hyperspot/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/242#pullrequestreview-3661692369","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/242","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/242#pullrequestreview-3661692369"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/242"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-14T16:42:27Z","commit_id":"a95d2e82661acea0b00d9b5af41f71694bac3315