summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n> -/// Decode `SecurityCtx` from gRPC metadata.\n> +/// Decode `SecurityContext` from gRPC metadata.\n> ```\n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📜 Review details</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Pro\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between f95cb339faf2bd25988133f089c3db5c951d43eb and 54755f2e6d8ec75c85bb8155c3135dcaa2817c6a.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⛔ Files ignored due to path filters (1)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.lock` is excluded by `!**/*.lock`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (12)</summary>\n\n* `Cargo.toml`\n* `deny.toml`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/api.rs`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/client.rs`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway-sdk/src/api.rs`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway-sdk/src/client.rs`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway/src/api/rest/handlers.rs`\n* `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway/src/domain/service.rs`\n* `libs/modkit-security/Cargo.toml`\n* `libs/modkit-security/src/bin_codec.rs`\n* `libs/modkit-security/tests/bin_codec.rs`\n* `libs/modkit-transport-grpc/src/lib.rs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>💤 Files with no reviewable changes (1)</summary>\n\n* deny.toml\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧰 Additional context used</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧬 Code graph analysis (5)</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/client.rs (4)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/api.rs (1)</summary>\n\n* `add` (15-15)\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway-sdk/src/api.rs (1)</summary