s/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\n\n**Test case appears incomplete - `name` parameter is unused.**\n\nThe `query_user_by_name` function takes a `name` parameter but doesn't actually concatenate it into the SQL query. This may not trigger the lint as intended since there's no actual string concatenation with user input.\n\nCompare with `query_user_by_id` on line 5 which properly demonstrates the pattern:\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n fn query_user_by_name(name: &str) {\n     // Should trigger DE0705 - prebuilt SQL query\n-    let _query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = \".to_string();\n+    let _query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '\".to_string() + name + \"'\";\n }\n```\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>\n\n> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\n> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\n\n```suggestion\nfn query_user_by_name(name: &str) {\n    // Should trigger DE0705 - prebuilt SQL query\n    let _query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '\".to_string() + name + \"'\";\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- suggestion_end -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn\n`@dylint_lints/de07_security/de0705_no_prebuild_sql_queries/ui/bad_prebuild_queries.rs`\naround lines 8 - 11, The test case for query_user_by_name is incomplete because\nthe name parameter is unused; modify the function query_user_by_name to actually\nincorporate the name into the SQL string (e.g., via simple concatenation or\nformat! into _query) so it mirrors the unsafe pattern shown by query_user_by_id\nand will trigger DE0705; ensure you update the _query variable in\nquery_user_by_name to i