c.md` around\nlines 15 - 18, Update the \"Default settings for new users\" scenario to define\nthe exact JSON response shape for first-time retrievals (explicitly state\nwhether \"theme\" and \"language\" are null, empty string, or omitted) and make the\nsame explicit representation in the PATCH-create scenario; reference the\nscenario title \"Default settings for new users\" and the fields \"theme\" and\n\"language\" so tests/clients know the canonical format and ensure the\nPATCH-create example shows the created record matching that exact JSON shape.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 738ad1c","created_at":"2026-01-16T12:08:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T15:45:06Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/223#discussion_r2698280141","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/223","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2698280141"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/223#discussion_r2698280141"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/223"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2698280141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":15,"original_start_line":15,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":24,"original_line":18,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":18,"position":24,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2698280144","pull_request_review_id":3670586975,"id":2698280144,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6g1HzQ","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@\n+//! Error types for the settings SDK.\n+\n+use thiserror::Error;\n+\n+#[derive(Error, Debug, Clone)]\n+pub enum