</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: After deployment, archive changes by moving `changes/[name]/` to `changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-[name]/`, updating `specs/` if capabilities changed, and running `openspec validate --strict`\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/changes/archive/2026-01-15-add-settings-module-rust/proposal.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Use `openspec archive <change-id> [--yes|-y]` for tooling-only changes with `--skip-specs` flag, always passing the change ID explicitly\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Use `openspec spec list --long`, `openspec list`, and ripgrep (`rg`) for searching; prefer ripgrep only for full-text search of requirements and scenarios\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Create proposal.md file for all changes that add features, make breaking changes, change architecture/patterns, optimize performance, or update security patterns\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`