rate MUST include a `test_comment_annotations_match_stderr` test using `lint_utils::test_comment_annotations_match_stderr` to validate comment/stderr alignment\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/simple-user-settings/src/api/rest/handlers.rs`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: After deployment, archive changes by moving `changes/[name]/` to `changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-[name]/`, updating `specs/` if capabilities changed, and running `openspec validate --strict`\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/changes/archive/2026-01-15-add-settings-module-rust/proposal.md`\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/spec.md : When using MODIFIED Requirements, paste the full, updated requirement content (header + all scenarios); partial deltas will drop previous details at archive time\n```\n\n**Applied to files:**\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/changes/archive/2026-01-15-add-settings-module-rust/specs/user-settings/spec.md`\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/AGENTS.md`\n- `modules/simple-user-settings/openspec/specs/user-settings/spec.md`\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>📚 Learning: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types-registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:55.263Z\nLearning: Applies to modules/system/types-registry/openspec/openspec/changes/**/specs/**/sp