pendencies/imports across apps and examples.\n\n## Changes\n\n|Cohort / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Workspace Manifests** <br> `Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types-sdk/Cargo.toml`|Added `modules/system/types` and `modules/system/types-sdk` as workspace members and new crate manifests.|\n|**App & Example Manifests** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml`, `examples/plugin-modules/.../Cargo.toml`|Added path dependency on `modules/system/types` to server and example plugin/gateway Cargo.tomls.|\n|**App Imports / Module Attributes** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/src/registered_modules.rs`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/src/module.rs`|Imported `types` crate in server; renamed gateway module to `tenant_resolver_gw` and added `types` to module deps.|\n|**ModKit Packaging & Build** <br> `libs/modkit/Cargo.toml`, `libs/modkit/build.rs`, `libs/modkit/schemas/manifest.json`, `libs/modkit/schemas/*.schema.json`|Added `zip` dependency and build script to produce `core_gts_schemas.zip` (includes manifest.json and `*.schema.json`); added schema and manifest files.|\n|**Schema Loading Logic** <br> `libs/modkit/src/gts/schemas.rs`|Refactored to load embedded `core_gts_schemas.zip`, extract and parse multiple `.schema.json` files, and return Vec<serde_json::Value>; added ZIP handling and updated error/logging.|\n|**Types Crate Implementation** <br> `modules/system/types/src/lib.rs`, `modules/system/types/src/module.rs`, `modules/system/types/src/domain/*`|New `types` module that obtains core schemas, registers them with `types_registry`, exposes `Types` module and a `TypesLocalClient` ready-check implementation.|\n|**Types SDK** <br> `modules/system/types-sdk/src/lib.rs`, `modules/system/types-sdk/src/api.rs`, `modules/system/types-sdk/src/error.rs`|New SDK crate exposing `TypesClient` trait and `TypesError` type (with unit tests); crate-level attributes and re-exports added.|\n|**TypesRegistry Update** <br> `modules/system/types_registry/types_registry/src/module.rs`|Removed in-module registration of core GTS schemas and updated docs to indicate `types` performs core schema registration.|\n\n## Sequence Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Build as \"ModKit build.rs\"\n    participant Archive as \"core_gts_schemas.zip\"\n    participant Types as \"types module\"\n    participant Registry as \"types_registry\"\n    participant Plugin as \"plugin modules\"\n\n    Build->>Archive: package manifest.json + *.schema.json\n    Note over Build,Archive: embed ZIP in crate OUT_DIR (deflate, unix perms)\n\n    Types->>Archive: load embedded ZIP at runtime\n    activate Types\n    Types->>Types: extract & parse each `.schema.json`\n    Types->>Registry: register_schemas(parsed_schemas)\n    Registry-->>Types: ack registration\n    deactivate Types\n\n    Plugin->>Registry: use registry APIs\n    Plugin->>Types: query readiness via `TypesClient`\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~20 minutes\n\n## Possibly related issues\n\n- `#156`: Move core GTS types registration out of types_registry module — this PR implements that objective by delegating registration to the new `types` module.  \n- `hypernetix/hyperspot#362`: Appears to match the same migration of core GTS registration from `types_registry` to `types` (schema handling and registration changes).\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- `hypernetix/hyperspot#272`: Similar refactor pattern moving local client implementations into domain layer — related to `TypesLocalClient` placement.  \n- `hypernetix/hyperspot#273`: Related change grouping local in-process clients under `domain/local_client` paths.\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- MikeFalcon77  \n- Bechma\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 I zipped the schemas snug and neat,  \n> > Core types hopped out and took their seat,  \n> > Registry passed the torch along,  \n> > Plugins found their names made strong,  \n> > A tiny hop—now all's complete!\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3 | ❌ 2</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>❌ Failed checks (2 inconclusive)</summary>\n\n|         Check name         | Status         | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                         | Resolution                                                                                                                                         |\n| :------------------------: | :------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|         Title check        | ❓ Inconclusive | The pull request title is incomplete and truncated, making it unclear what specific action was taken.                                                                               | Complete the title to clearly state the full objective, e.g., 'Move core GTS types registration from types_registry to types module'.              |\n| Out of Scope Changes check | ❓ Inconclusive | The pull request introduces additional changes beyond core objective: new zip dependency, build.rs script, schema files, and schema loading refactor may represent scope expansion. | Clarify whether embedding GTS schemas in a ZIP archive and the related build infrastructure are part of the original requirements from issue `#156`. |\n\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|      Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                          |\n| :-----------------: | :------