(https://app.codecov.io/gh/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/201?dropdown=coverage&src=pr&el=h1&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=github&utm_content=comment&utm_campaign=pr+comments&utm_term=None) Report\n:white_check_mark: All modified and coverable lines are covered by tests.\n\n:loudspeaker: Thoughts on this report? [Let us know!](https://github.com/codecov/feedback/issues/255)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3706482735/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":200,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/200","source_state":"closed","source_author":"Artifizer","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #200] feat(dylint): add DE0110 lint to prohibit schema_for!() on GTS structs","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"oagw-initial","pr_head_sha":"3638902409ff8c10c990aec47a55d899ad7fe308","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"Artifizer","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/200","id":3143053252,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs67Vy_E","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/200","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/200.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/200.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/200","number":200,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(dylint): add DE0110 lint to prohibit schema_for!() on GTS structs","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add new dylint lint DE0110_NO_SCHEMA_FOR_ON_GTS_STRUCTS that detects usage of `schemars::schema_for!()` macro on GTS-wrapped structs.\r\n\r\nGTS structs (those using `#[struct_to_gts_schema]`) must use `gts_json_schema_with_refs()` instead because:\r\n\r\n1. It is already computed at compile time\r\n2. It automatically sets the correct `$id` field (gts://gts.a.b.c.d.v1~...)\r\n3. It generates proper `$ref` references instead of inlining (gts://gts.a.b.c.d.v1~...)\r\n\r\nThe lint is a LateLintPass that:\r\n- Detects `into_root_schema_for` method calls (schema_for! expansion)\r\n- Checks if the type has GTS_SCHEMA_ID associated constant\r\n- Reports error with help suggesting the correct method\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Artifizer <artifizer@gmail.com>","created_at":"2026-01-02T23:16:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T23:22:15Z","closed_at":"2026-01-02T23:16:32Z","merged_at":"2026-01-02T23:16:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"fadadf7c6afdbefa1311af0030559d8edccd80f8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/200/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/200/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.g