},"body":"Add DE0802 dylint: enforce OperationBuilderODataExt for OData parameters\r\n    \r\n- Detect .query_param()/.query_param_typed() calls on OperationBuilder with OData params\r\n- Suggest using .with_odata_filter(), .with_odata_orderby(), .with_odata_select() instead\r\n- Covers $filter, $orderby, $select, $top, $skip, $count parameters\r\n- Include UI tests with valid/invalid examples\r\n- Update dylint_lints README with new lint entry\r\n- Update MODKIT_PLUGINS, MODKIT_UNIFIED_SYSTEM, NEW_MODULE\r\n    \r\nThis enforces type-safe OData registration and prevents bypassing the\r\ntype-safe OData system that provides compile-time validation and automatic\r\nOpenAPI schema generation.\r\n    \r\nFix: https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/issues/178\r\n    \r\nSigned-off-by: Artifizer <artifizer@gmail.com>","created_at":"2026-01-02T16:23:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-02T19:04:08Z","closed_at":"2026-01-02T19:04:08Z","merged_at":"2026-01-02T19:04:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"80d8480274b7bcd953c55967eb36fd195ef6adc6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/192/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/192/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/192/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/4166a9f0772663d1be2d2da55ad6b81a1d780024","head":{"label":"Artifizer:odata-dylints","ref":"odata-dylints","sha":"4166a9f0772663d1be2d2da55ad6b81a1d780024","user":{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","f